# Unity editor scratch. The repo-root .gitignore anchors its /Temp/ and
# /Library/ rules to the root, so they never matched this nested project and
# the noise came in anyway. This file is scoped to the project that generates
# it.
#
# Library/ is deliberately NOT listed: it is already tracked from earlier
# commits, and adding it here would only hide changes to files git still
# follows. Untracking it is a separate, history-touching decision.
Temp/
EditorInstance.json
